{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_011_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36ced3a49d01f10ed1210e58b630dc61828e62b308edded5d36f083a058f01f8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ef67a8e13b37f5dbdda8903ddfbc89647a0efdcab45131f4a692441da2ad14",
      "text": "挑礼物，好兴奋，好开心！\n但是，要想对方想要什么，超级难……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbb59d391e0c62498afd4e7d6bb1c7f8b473730836750b36a5cd62fe28f41a6",
      "text": "是啊，选吃的吧种类太多，\n选衣服吧又容易变成我们自己喜欢的风格，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758751e8e8e2486a930abb02b9dc2ff5fb9454870c2c2bbe90837c4a9d5090da",
      "text": "作为最后手段的偶像周边……的话，\n就更难了。可能会买重啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cf014450fb89ea704d6556dd16c772220b1fff56dbaea7e6a03fd43a938a4d9",
      "text": "要挑最适合实的，好难。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0ab287b864163b2ed531412ab760494048e510f9a85e311ba56a051af34fa3b",
      "text": "（恭二先生和皮埃尔先生一脸严肃地在聊着什么……过去打个招呼吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d8199435e35a63f8dfa1b97fc4bccc214f2888398cf57f6b088e4135bf0d5f4",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n你们在聊什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f57d92cf04f92a7f9be9853cf9f6122be1ee1e50e2a78aa0bcadb98305e633",
      "text": "辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdb4e1dc4dd5d272f5c9ee28b4a38b962fad9b9ba02f0ab5dddad1278406e5f1",
      "text": "实马上就要过生日了！\n我和恭二在找礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2896dd94006c621e94aa6238774f2760be112d2c6421b6270866c8215a0b64ad",
      "text": "看了不少东西，但还没定下来到底送什么好。喂，要是换作你，会送什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0850366029117adeeccbdafbc1974b03c7c74e2a15f2293f78ee832c70e046",
      "text": "原来如此，那确实挺伤脑筋的呢。\n如果是我的话，让我想想……送花吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdb8dc944a67d888571fe6abb4ae4fa3c3784fb1bb40010a42fc1be14a71d364",
      "text": "花吗。送实先生花，\n太理所当然了反而完全没想到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4667f7171d02ab2bf842903073b220f8889527cc1a26c4521da3d99b53c2299",
      "text": "花花，我觉得很棒！想做世界上独一无二的、\n送给实的礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3279deb0a14223c11c8595316642976dfa311177c5dc010d655cd2924b6ac9d",
      "text": "问题是能不能做出够格送给实先生的东西啊。\n这么一想，门槛可真高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4807be9ff697180864b651edc065d5f7836c8f54e57ced248f29db8d9af97f0",
      "text": "只要是两位亲手制作的花，\n实先生绝对会非常高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20ad42f63ec246f9aa5a9d5caa51f1f35ff9b548bfcd4477b75bea8069f891c0",
      "text": "……也是啊。\n与其在这儿胡思乱想，不如先动手试试看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9fc3d27908c36a2a898c41a5790efc620a677c325cc9eeb8e7fbf6370631637",
      "text": "既然如此，要不要去问问实先生以前打工的那家花店，看能不能请他们帮帮忙呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ed806d663a4dcbd07908cb6a8efb904fea59f8cdeae8aaeb735208ae7ae06d1",
      "text": "谢谢！\n制作人，拜托——啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
